            "summary": "Raise a card dispute",
            "description": "As a Customer, I want to dispute a card payment within 60 days, so that I get a temporary credit while the bank investigates.\n\nh4. Acceptance criteria\n# Given a card payment made 10 days ago, when the customer raises a dispute, then a temporary credit is posted\n# Given a card payment made 90 days ago, when the customer raises a dispute, then the dispute is refused with the reason\n\nh4. Source\n* Scenario: \"expects a temporary credit while the bank investigates\"\n* Question: How long does the customer have to raise a dispute? Answer: 60 days\n\nRequirements: REQ-001, REQ-002",
            "labels": [
              "scenario-import",
